# Read by Flux's source-controller when it repacks this chart from the OCI
# registry, before helm-controller renders it.
#
# Its default ignore patterns include `*.png`, so the favicons in `branding/`
# were dropped from the chart. This resulted in the Grafana subPath mount
# failing, and the Grafana pod crashlooping.
#
# These patterns are applied after the defaults, so this re-includes them.
!*.png
